+   "payload": {"kind": "agentTurn", "message": "Run bear-share-sync pipeline"},
+   "sessionTarget": "isolated"

### references/canvas_schema.md  [docs]
- # Canvas Schema Reference
- ## agent_capabilities.canvas
- The canvas file uses JSON Canvas format (Obsidian-compatible) with these conventions:
- - **Node types**: `text` for shared knowledge capsules
- - **Color code `"4"`** (green) for #share-sourced nodes
- - **Auto-positioning**: new nodes placed below the lowest existing node with 40px gap
- - **Node ID format**: `share_<sanitized_bear_note_id>` (alphanumeric + underscore only)
- - **Text format**: `📌 <title>\n<summary excerpt>`
- ### Example node
- ```json
- {
-   "id": "share_ABC123",
-   "type": "text",
-   "text": "📌 Research Methodology\nA concise summary of the note content...",
-   "x": 0,
-   "y": 240,
-   "width": 280,
-   "height": 120,
-   "color": "4"
- }
- ```

